      "label": "team_0030_botan_05",
      "hash64": "EDF58BD53E7467B3",
      "text": "But, um. I’m helping out with Operation Starfall\\nas part of my independent study... You know,\\r\\nthe Treasure Hunt.\\c\\nI’m good with machines and hacking and stuff,\\nso I’ll be working behind the scenes.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
